  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Programme addressing irregular, unsafe migration through and from Ethiopia</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Danish Refugee Council (DRC) is leading the Ethiopia Migration Programme (EMP) together with partners Save the Children International (SC), BBC Media Action (BBC MA), Mixed Migration Centre (MMC) and Altai Consulting (AC). The programme objective is to protect young &#x2013; 14 to 29 year-old &#x2013; would-be be migrants and refugees from unsafe irregular migration through and from Ethiopia. This programme is part of the UK Department for International Development (DFID) Ethiopia&#x2019;s refugee and migration business case for 2016&#x2010;2020 aimed at addressing problems associated with forced inward migration and unsafe irregular outward migration.</narrative>
  </description>
